{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CeUfHpXccXtz78sTDuy6w","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HuZjmdPwzSiCQcvbxB6LAu","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"revisions":[{"revision_id":"R001","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"head back to Irkkk\" 与「回伊尔克去」意义一致，无漏译或增译。"},{"revision_id":"R002","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"标记 #LIGHT_GREEN#/#WHITE# 与星号完整保留，\"control the training facilities\"→「用于控制训练室」。"},{"revision_id":"R003","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"impressed with your mastery\"→「对你的熟练程度印象深刻」，\"handle stronger energy flows\"→「驾驭更强能量流」。"},{"revision_id":"R004","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"两段日志的时间线、\"staging point for further aggression\"→「进一步侵犯……的前进基地」、\"none seem to have been anywhere near Ardhungol\"→「都没有靠近阿尔德胡格」均一致，标记 #{bold}#/#{normal}# 保留。"},{"revision_id":"R005","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"If you say so.\"→「既然你这么说。」语义对应。"},{"revision_id":"R006","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"infinite dungeon\"→「无尽地下城」。"},{"revision_id":"R007","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"though he would be defeated he would still come back, sometimes after hundreds of years\"→「即使他被打败了，仍会卷土重来，有时甚至隔了数百年」，因果与转折关系保持。"},{"revision_id":"R008","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Not enough money\"→「金钱不足」。"},{"revision_id":"R009","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"地理关系 \"Derthfields on the western border of the Thaloren forest\"→「自然精灵森林西部边境……德斯荒野」，\"To the west lies ... Kor'Pul\"→「向西走还有……卡·普尔废墟」，占位符 @name@ 与颜色标记保留。"},{"revision_id":"R010","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"I will, thanks.\"→「我收下了，谢谢。」为接受语境的常见对应，无可证实的意义反转。"},{"revision_id":"R011","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"关键情节如 \"pull out my tongue with the blacksmith's tongs\"→「用铁匠的火钳扯出我的舌头」、\"do you reject magic in all its forms?\"→「你拒绝一切形式的魔法吗？」、\"Even if I still had a tongue\"→「即使舌头尚在」均对应。"},{"revision_id":"R012","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"墓志三行与年份 \"97 - 121\" 保留，\"Unlifed in grimmest darkness\"→「未能在最冷酷的黑暗中生存」属可接受意译。"},{"revision_id":"R013","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"the dark places I shall walk\"→「即将踏足的黑暗之地」，选项标记 [kiss her]→[亲吻她] 保留。"},{"revision_id":"R014","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Breath weapons\"→「吐息武器」、\"A high equilibrium makes for a chance to fail to use a power and lose a turn\"→「失衡值过高可能导致能力使用失败并损失一个回合」，颜色标记完整。"},{"revision_id":"R015","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"a letter to Aletta from the Master\"→「领主写给阿蕾塔的信」，收信人/寄信人方向一致；\"the Master\"的称谓译法无双语内证可判为错。"},{"revision_id":"R016","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"You can count on me, Protector.\"→「交给我吧，守护者。」称呼与语义保留。"},{"revision_id":"R017","verdict":"DEFECT","observation":"称谓错译：\"assassin lord\"（刺客领主）被译为「盗贼领主」，身份类别被改。","evidence":"source: \"the assassin lord says\"；target: 「盗贼领主说道」，assassin 对应刺客而非盗贼(thief)。"},{"revision_id":"R018","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Escort\"→「护送」。"},{"revision_id":"R019","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"We should have finished you off that day. You deserved no mercy!\"→「我们那天真该彻底除掉你。你根本不配得到怜悯！」主客体一致，#VIOLET#/#LAST# 保留。"},{"revision_id":"R020","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"The Spellblaze Chronicles(7): Into Darkness\"→「魔法大爆炸纪事(7)：进入黑暗」，编号与副标题对应。"},{"revision_id":"R021","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"alter your basic properties\"→「调整你的基础属性」，对象与动作一致。"},{"revision_id":"R022","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"两项价格与内容对应：50 gold→50金币（技巧/战斗训练系）；8 gold→8金币（射击天赋，弓和投石索）。"},{"revision_id":"R023","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"[teleport]\"→「[传送]」，括号标记保留。"},{"revision_id":"R024","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Never seen an undead have you?\"→「你没见过不死生物吗？」反意疑问的语义保持。"},{"revision_id":"R025","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"[attack Krogar]\"→「[攻击克罗加尔]」。"},{"revision_id":"R026","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"占位符 %0.2f、%d%% 与「7 回合」数量均保留，\"strips you of one random detrimental magical effect\"→「除去你受到的一个随机负面魔法效果」。"},{"revision_id":"R027","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"三则日期与内容对应，\"two giant... legs, growing from the cavern\"→「两条巨大的……腿，仿佛正从洞穴中生长出来」，末段推测的主客体关系一致。"},{"revision_id":"R028","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"[Follow him]\"→「[跟着他]」。"},{"revision_id":"R029","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Farewell.\"→「再见。」"},{"revision_id":"R030","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"What do you propose?\"→「那……你的建议呢？」提问对象与内容一致。"},{"revision_id":"R031","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Thank you, Elisa!\"→「谢谢你，埃莉萨！」"},{"revision_id":"R032","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"占位符 @playername@ 保留，\"be quick as my time is precious\"→「请长话短说，我的时间很宝贵」。"},{"revision_id":"R033","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"able to absorb the power of places, and beings\"→「可以吸收地点和生物的力量」，\"a warmaster in Reknor\"→「瑞库纳的一位战争领主」，署名与 #GOLD# 标记保留。"},{"revision_id":"R034","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"This sounds strange. I need to think about it.\"→「听起来有点奇怪，我要考虑一下。」"},{"revision_id":"R035","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"Light [%d]\"→「光系 [%d]」，占位符 %d 保留。"},{"revision_id":"R036","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","evidence":"\"reveals locked talent category\"→「揭示锁定的技能树」，价格 100 gold→100 金币一致。"},{"revision_id":"R037","verdict":"NO_DEFECT","observation":"NO_DEFECT","ev